% expect-error: rangecheck
% Scenario: an image dictionary of a type other than 1, 3, or 4 is a
% rangecheck in image, and nothing is painted.
<< /ImageType 2 /Width 2 /Height 2 /BitsPerComponent 8
   /ImageMatrix [2 0 0 -2 0 2] /DataSource <004080FF> >> image
showpage
